      "html": "<div data-schema-version=\"9\"><p>HUSKY：skateboarding: non-holonomic constraints + coupled human-object interactions, Learning-based framework (skateboard system modeling + physics-aware whole-body control)</p>\n<p>AMP</p>\n<p>System Modeling:</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" width=\"194\" height=\"34\" data-attachment-key=\"F5TCQUNQ\"></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" width=\"458\" height=\"389\" data-attachment-key=\"AJU4HE89\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\" data-indent=\"1\">truck steering angle is determined by the board tilt</p>\n<p>Humanoid Skateboarding Task</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\" data-indent=\"1\">Pushing + Steering</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\" data-indent=\"1\"></p>\n<p>METHOD</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" width=\"872\" height=\"345\" data-attachment-key=\"ADFDGQH5\"></p>\n<p>A. Problem Formulation - RL</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\" data-indent=\"1\"><img alt=\"\" width=\"490\" height=\"207\" data-attachment-key=\"Z7JNY3ND\"></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" width=\"485\" height=\"156\" data-attachment-key=\"C44HWZ6R\"></p>\n<p>B.AMP for Pushing Style</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\" data-indent=\"1\">observation: robot joint angles</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\" data-indent=\"1\">loss of Discriminator:</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\" data-indent=\"1\"><img alt=\"\" width=\"393\" height=\"93\" data-attachment-key=\"TIS5CNSZ\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\" data-indent=\"1\">reward of policy</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\" data-indent=\"1\"><img alt=\"\" width=\"411\" height=\"95\" data-attachment-key=\"DJVGX9ZY\"></p>\n<p>C. Physics-Guided Heading-Oriented Steering</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" width=\"471\" height=\"247\" data-attachment-key=\"T7LT994I\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\" data-indent=\"1\">Smoothness considered:</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\" data-indent=\"1\"><img alt=\"\" width=\"478\" height=\"231\" data-attachment-key=\"JDHEZ2ZE\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\" data-indent=\"1\">tilt + heading reward</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\" data-indent=\"1\"><img alt=\"\" width=\"419\" height=\"63\" data-attachment-key=\"SI5PEZPH\"><img alt=\"\" width=\"228\" height=\"21\" data-attachment-key=\"BZEUBKSF\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\" data-indent=\"1\">D. Trajectory Planning for Phase Transition - pushing to steering</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 80px;\" data-indent=\"2\">Essential Positions + Bezier curve</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\" data-indent=\"1\"><img alt=\"\" width=\"483\" height=\"223\" data-attachment-key=\"UW29PVJF\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\" data-indent=\"1\"><img alt=\"\" width=\"466\" height=\"150\" data-attachment-key=\"F6IQLQ5G\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\" data-indent=\"1\"><img alt=\"\" width=\"115\" height=\"23\" data-attachment-key=\"HF52PWZG\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\" data-indent=\"1\">E. Sim-to-Real Transfer</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 80px;\" data-indent=\"2\">a. Skateboard Physical Identification</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 80px;\" data-indent=\"2\"><img alt=\"\" width=\"486\" height=\"183\" data-attachment-key=\"4I234853\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\" data-indent=\"1\"><img alt=\"\" width=\"488\" height=\"117\" data-attachment-key=\"6NFYAZRU\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 80px;\" data-indent=\"2\">b. Domain Randomization<img alt=\"\" width=\"386\" height=\"230\" data-attachment-key=\"K7TTSPH7\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\" data-indent=\"1\"></p>\n<p></p>\n</div>",
